 {'from': 'human', 'value': 'Can you write a program in Java that prompts the user to enter the name of a famous person and then displays a brief biography of that person? Use the Wikipedia API to retrieve the information and parse the response in JSON format.'}
 {'from': 'gpt', 'value': 'Sure, here's a Java program that prompts the user to enter the name of a famous person and then uses the Wikipedia API to retrieve their biography in JSON format:
```java
import java.io.BufferedReader;
import java.io.InputStreamReader;
import java.net.HttpURLConnection;
import java.net.URL;
import org.json.JSONObject;
public class FamousPersonBio {
 public static void main(String[] args) {
 try {
 // Prompt the user to enter the name of a famous person
 System.out.print("Enter the name of a famous person: ");
 BufferedReader reader = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));
 String name = reader.readLine();

 // Build the Wikipedia API URL for the person's biography
 String apiUrl = "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/api.php?action=query&format=json∝=extracts&exintro=true&redirects=true&titles=" + name.replace(" ", "%20");

 // Send an HTTP GET request to the Wikipedia API
 URL url = new URL(apiUrl);
 HttpURLConnection connection = (HttpURLConnection) url.openConnection();
 connection.setRequestMethod("GET");
 connection.setRequestProperty("User-Agent", "Mozilla/5.0");

 // Parse the JSON response from the Wikipedia API
 BufferedReader responseReader = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(connection.getInputStream()));
 StringBuilder response = new StringBuilder();
 String line;
 while ((line = responseReader.readLine()) != null) {
 response.append(line);
 }
 responseReader.close();
 JSONObject jsonResponse = new JSONObject(response.toString());
 JSONObject pages = jsonResponse.getJSONObject("query").getJSONObject("pages");
 String pageId = pages.keys().next();
 String bio = pages.getJSONObject(pageId).getString("extract");

 // Display the person's biography
 System.out.println(bio);
 } catch (Exception e) {
 System.out.println("Error: " + e.getMessage());
 }
 }
}
```
When you run this program, it will prompt you to enter the name of a famous person. After you enter the name, the program will use the Wikipedia API to retrieve the person's biography in JSON format. It will then parse the JSON response and display the biography to the user.'}
